ent_title_status":""},"say:19:1041204015:1":{"text":"我は茨の護衛隊副官として、常に気を抜くことなく厳粛でいなければならない。森の中で、我と仲良くなろうとする者など、ほとんどいない……","source_cn":"吾身为荆棘副官，需得时时肃穆，不可有片刻懈怠。丛林众人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96019C36850C50DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041204016:1":{"text":"もし気分を害したのなら……お二方殿、どうか我の無礼を許していただきたい！","source_cn":"若有冒犯……恳请两位，宽恕吾的无礼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5491047FE85570E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041204017:1":{"text":"えぇ、うーん……！ま、まったくですよ。いくら私たちを可愛いと褒めても、その要求は……","source_cn":"呃，唔……！真、真是的，就算你夸我们可爱，这要求也实在是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25514FE84C880B9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041204018:1":{"text":"構わぬ、断られることは予想できていた。そもそも無礼な頼みだったのだ！","source_cn":"无妨，遭拒在吾意料之中，本就是无礼请求！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30C2B1D68AE3862","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041204019:1":{"text":"……えぇい、もうやけっぱちです！ロンロン、カブラと握手するわよ！","source_cn":"……算了，豁出去了！满满，咱们和卡夫拉握握手吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5457F0725742B472","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1041204020:1":{"text":"怖がらないの！きっと、カブラさんはそこまで怖い人じゃないわ！ハムスターを食べたりもしないわよ！","source_cn":"不要害怕！卡夫拉看起来不是那么可怕的人！也不会以仓鼠为食！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x752DD9A4D6EB0619","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1041204021:0":{"text":"わ……分かったよ。握手だけなら、ロンロンも……勇気を出すね！","source_cn":"好……好吧，只是握手的话，满满会……鼓足勇气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE684C12F40E980A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1041204022:0":{"text":"お二方殿、感謝する。おかげで、我の願いが叶ったぞ！","source_cn":"多谢诸位，吾的心愿，今日已近实现！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEEEAB6D93F7DD69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"何が言いたいんだ？思い切って言ってみろよ！","source_cn":"你想说什么？大胆说出来！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA020BB61D97A70BE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"何が言いたいんだ？思い切って言ってみろよ！","female":"何が言いたいの？思い切って言ってみて！","variant_male_record_index":"61412","variant_female_record_index":"61413","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"カブラ、どうしてここに？","source_cn":"卡夫拉，你怎么来了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDFA8D2BA2991CFCA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"カブラ、どうしてここに？","female":"カブラ、どうしてここに？","variant_male_record_index":"61410","variant_female_record_index":"61411","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docum